{"id":"u-4b2cf86e-8c1a-42a2-aaef-15c46f132586","src":"community","title":"Greek God (Golden Ratio) V2","author":"Jaime","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/HzLO66-greek-god-golden-ratio-v2","desc":"A 4-day upper/lower block built for frame over mass: wide shoulders, wide back, small waist.\n\nSide delts get 12 cable sets a week and front delts get zero direct work, because pressing already feeds them. Pulling is split evenly between vertical and horizontal so the back builds width, not just thickness. Chest and triceps are trimmed to make room.\n\nWeighted pull-ups run 5×4–6 as a strength lift with double progression. Bench and barbell row stay heavy. Everything else is physique work.\n\nCalves are trained three times a week across both heads: seated for soleus, leg press for gastroc, 19 sets total. Forearms get reverse curls for the brachioradialis, plus strapless pulling.\n\nDays run free weights → cables → machines, with Smith work blocked together. Abs and back extensions are finishers. The leg press calf raise supersets with the leg press.\n\nProgression is load-based, so all four weeks look identical. Hit the top of the rep range on every set, then add weight. 0–1 RIR on compounds, 1–2 on isolation.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-14T01:04:06.206Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper A","Lower A","Upper B","Lower B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Neutral Grip, Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":5}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Extension (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"x":6}]},{"n":"Straight Arm Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Inverted Face Pull"